---
source: crates/rattler-bin/src/main.rs
expression: redact(subcommand.render_long_help().to_string())
---
Generates a completion script for a shell

Usage: rattler completion [OPTIONS] --shell <SHELL>

Options:
  -s, --shell <SHELL>
          The shell to generate a completion script for

          Possible values:
          - bash:       Bash shell
          - elvish:     Elvish shell
          - fish:       Fish shell
          - nushell:    Nushell
          - powershell: `PowerShell` shell
          - zsh:        Zsh shell

  -v, --verbose
          Log verbose

      --offline
          Disable network access and use only locally cached data

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
